OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome
OL,6,Fbrightness initially this evening,
OL,7,Falthough turning cloudy through the
OL,8,Fnight, with the potential for light
OL,9,Frain throughout, rain perhaps turning
OL,10,Fheavy in the east later by dawn. Light
OL,11,Fwinds to start but becoming breezy by
OL,12,Fsunrise.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FOn Wednesday, outbreaks of
OL,15,Frain will clear eastwards leaving
OL,16,Fsunny spells and a cooler feel in a
OL,17,Ffresh northerly breeze. Some light
OL,18,Fshowers arriving in the west during
OL,19,Fthe evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
