OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FOn
OL,6,FThursday, sunny spells with showers
OL,7,Feasing, and feeling cool in a
OL,8,Fnorthwesterly breeze. Cloud thickening
OL,9,Finto Friday, bringing rain and
OL,10,Fblustery winds. Becoming more settled
OL,11,Fon Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
